    "section": "Mission Sequence",
    "summary": "Award 10 VP to each player whose army meets the Battle Ready painting standard. Highest VP wins, with equal totals a draw. Disregard points above the applicable limits. Primary scoring and secondary scoring each have a 45 VP game cap and a 15 VP round cap. Battle Ready contributes at most 10 VP. Each Fixed Secondary Mission card has its own additional limit of 20 VP.",
